# knowledge/ is tracked: it is the source-of-truth input to seed_knowledge.py.
# .streamlit/config.toml is tracked so the dark theme survives a fresh clone,
# but credentials must never be committed (see 7705e07 for what happened last
# time). Keep the secrets file ignored explicitly.
.secrets.toml
